OPERATION                    LEVEL     METHOD  PATH                                     NOTE
DCIM_INDEX                   verified  GET     /videos/DCIM/                            HTML listing; sort params nd dd sd
GPCAMERA_OPENGOPRO_VERSION   verified  GET     /gopro/version                           {"version":"2.0"}
GPCAMERA_WEBCAM_EXIT_OGP     verified  GET     /gopro/webcam/exit                       returns status idle (1), not off (0), on 72.70
GPCAMERA_WEBCAM_PREVIEW_OGP  verified  GET     /gopro/webcam/preview                    
GPCAMERA_WEBCAM_START_OGP    verified  GET     /gopro/webcam/start                      mode switch takes ~3 s; 1280x720 h264 30fps + aac at ~6.4 Mbit/s to UDP 8554. A 5 s client timeout that aborted it once wedged /gopro/camera/state (500) until power cycle — use >=30 s
GPCAMERA_WEBCAM_STATUS_OGP   verified  GET     /gopro/webcam/status                     status 1 idle, error 0
GPCAMERA_WEBCAM_STOP_OGP     verified  GET     /gopro/webcam/stop                       
GPCAMERA_WEBCAM_VERSION_OGP  verified  GET     /gopro/webcam/version                    version 4, usb_3_1_compatible true
GP_ANALYTICS_GET             verified  GET     /gp/gpControl/analytics/get              binary blob
GP_INFO                      verified  GET     /gp/gpControl/info                       
GP_MEDIA_LIST                verified  GET     /gp/gpMediaList                          
GP_SOFTUPDATE_FORM           verified  GET     /gp/gpSoftUpdate                         HTML multipart form; dangerous
GP_STATUS                    verified  GET     /gp/gpControl/status                     
GP_WEBCAM_STATUS             verified  GET     /gp/gpWebcam/STATUS                      
GP_WEBCAM_VERSION            verified  GET     /gp/gpWebcam/VERSION                     
OGP_ADD_HILIGHT              verified  GET     /gopro/media/hilight/file                
OGP_DOWNLOAD_MEDIA           verified  GET     /videos/DCIM/{directory}/{filename}      HEAD returns 403; use Range GET
OGP_GET_DATE_AND_TIME_DST    verified  GET     /gopro/camera/get_date_time              200 with date/time; dst field absent
OGP_GET_STATE                verified  GET     /gopro/camera/state                      86 status + 88 setting ids
OGP_KEEP_ALIVE               verified  GET     /gopro/camera/keep_alive                 
OGP_MEDIA_GPMF               verified  GET     /gopro/media/gpmf                        
OGP_MEDIA_LIST               verified  GET     /gopro/media/list                        
OGP_MEDIA_SCREENNAIL         verified  GET     /gopro/media/screennail                  
OGP_MEDIA_TELEMETRY          verified  GET     /gopro/media/telemetry                   
OGP_MEDIA_THUMBNAIL          verified  GET     /gopro/media/thumbnail                   
OGP_PRESETS_GET              verified  GET     /gopro/camera/presets/get                
OGP_PRESET_LOAD              verified  GET     /gopro/camera/presets/load               
OGP_PRESET_SET_GROUP         verified  GET     /gopro/camera/presets/set_group          
OGP_PREVIEW_STREAM_START     verified  GET     /gopro/camera/stream/start               MPEG-TS h264 848x480 + aac to UDP 8554; 'port' param untested
OGP_PREVIEW_STREAM_STOP      verified  GET     /gopro/camera/stream/stop                
OGP_REMOVE_HILIGHT           verified  GET     /gopro/media/hilight/remove              
OGP_SET_ANALYTICS            verified  GET     /gopro/camera/analytics/set_client_info  
OGP_SHUTTER                  verified  GET     /gopro/camera/shutter/{mode}             spec omits HERO9; present on 1.72
OGP_TURBO_MODE_ENABLE        verified  GET     /gopro/media/turbo_transfer              
